    <article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg f5" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 class="heading-element" dir="auto">Welcome to the RISC-V Specifications 👋</h2><a id="user-content-welcome-to-the-risc-v-specifications-" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Welcome to the RISC-V Specifications 👋" href="#welcome-to-the-risc-v-specifications-"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c75e43a4bb5834341f53d3bf24fd8f868d99ca7ed2c44d0b77713790b8b1ca8a/68747470733a2f2f72697363762e6f72672f77702d636f6e74656e742f75706c6f6164732f323032302f30362f72697363762d636f6c6f722e737667"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c75e43a4bb5834341f53d3bf24fd8f868d99ca7ed2c44d0b77713790b8b1ca8a/68747470733a2f2f72697363762e6f72672f77702d636f6e74656e742f75706c6f6164732f323032302f30362f72697363762d636f6c6f722e737667" alt="RISC-V Logo" data-canonical-src="https://riscv.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/riscv-color.svg" style="max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
<p dir="auto">If you don't find what you're looking for here, try one of our other GitHub organizations:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv">ISA Specifications</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv-non-isa">Non-ISA Specifications</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv-software-src">RISC-V Software</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv-collab">Software Upstreaming</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv-android-src">RISC-V Android</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/riscv-admin">RISC-V Administrative Docs</a></li>
</ul>
</article>
